{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"cf8aade462f0445800657d08650cd2eafc767e7a2c26d2177927a3aece64399d","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP HTTP transport authentication and documentation","key_entities":["docs/mcp-auth.md","docs/adr/0050-mcp-optional-auth-resource-server.md","docs/mcp-reference.md","docs/env-vars.md","docs/README.md","scripts/check_server_manifest.py","scripts/gen_mcp_reference.py","scripts/gen_env_registry.py","scripts/check_docs_index.py","auth_strategies","auth_resource_server_url","http_allowed_hosts","http_allowed_origins","REBAR_MCP_READONLY","ALLOW_JIRA_SYNC","ALLOW_LLM"],"problem_keywords":["documentation","operator guide","MCP authentication","ADR","reference consistency","security model","verifier modes","resource server"],"propositions":["Operator guide `docs/mcp-auth.md` must document enabling HTTP transport with five verifier modes (static, jwt, introspection, proxy, custom), each with flat-config examples, stating the one-instance-per-strategy limitation.","Security model documentation must explain resource-server-only architecture, composite audience choke point, fail-closed behavior, no token passthrough, and DNS-rebinding/Origin defaults with non-loopback bind requirements.","Behind-a-proxy deployment guidance must specify TLS termination at edge with loopback rebind, external host in allowlists, and `auth_resource_server_url` as external https URL driving PRM resource and discovery, with concrete nginx/ALB example.","Three interactive-client connection paths (static bearer, automatic OAuth, pre-registered credentials) must be documented with examples of how rebar serves the PRM for discovery.","ADR 0050 must record resource-server-only decision, composite audience rationale, five verifier modes, transport-hardening vulnerability classes (DNS-rebinding, forwarded-header, confused-deputy, audience-confusion), and deferred items (AS/DCR, per-tool authz, rate-limiting, AWS deployment).","Reference artifacts `docs/mcp-reference.md`, `docs/env-vars.md`, and `server.json` manifest must be fully regenerated and drift gates must pass for integrated key set from S1–S6."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785819735093456214,"uuid":"fa54e94e-9ceb-4a31-9577-338625ccfc61"}